sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant Frontend as React Client
    participant API as FastAPI Router
    participant Auth as Firebase Auth Guard
    participant NLP as NLP Extractor
    participant ML as ML Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    User->>Frontend: Upload SRS Document / Input Size
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/estimates/analyze (Bearer Token)
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT Signature & Permissions
    Auth-->>API: User Context (Tenant, Role: Editor)
    
    alt Document Upload
        API->>NLP: Parse Text & Extract Signals
        NLP-->>API: Functional Size (size_fp, signals, confidence)
    end

    API->>ML: Estimate Effort (size_fp, org_actuals)
    ML->>ML: Compute Monotone Power-Law (P50)
    ML->>ML: Apply Mondrian Conformal Quantiles
    ML->>ML: Apply Empirical Bayes Shrinkage (if actuals exist)
    ML->>ML: Validate Non-Crossing Quantiles (P10..P90)
    ML-->>API: Estimation Result Spread (hours, PM, confidence)

    API->>DB: Persist Project & Estimate Record
    DB-->>API: Saved Record Confirmation
    API-->>Frontend: HTTP 200 JSON Response
    Frontend-->>User: Render Interactive Visualizations & Summary Cards
